# Records examples/demo/demo.gif with VHS (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs):
#   pnpm build && vhs examples/demo/demo.tape
Output examples/demo/demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1300
Set Height 300
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Type "npx tsx examples/demo/run.ts" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 7s
